  "body": "Independent repeated-square-root interval arithmetic reproduces all 18 PR1685 caps. A separate dynamic program certifies 1,100 unique integer optima across 7,414 transitions.\n\nThis is a deliberately independent audit of [PR1685](https://github.com/CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds/pull/1685) at cff9dc3042a7d774722610c86ea5bd76f38d7286. The precise mathematical domain, separately implemented method, failure controls, exact source pins, predecessor credit and open next question are in research/idle-stability-radical-audit/README.md. The predecessor result is credited; no defect or new original theorem is implied.\n\nValidation: Python3.12 registered replay and metadata/source checks pass; Python3.14 optimized replay produces the identical exact receipt; modified source and receipt controls reject; selected-record integrity and whitespace checks pass. No full cold/native/hosting/all-size replay or new kappa is claimed. Only this new package changes.\n\nReproduce: python3.12 scripts/research_package.py --package research/idle-stability-radical-audit.\n\nPrepared for woklerx with substantial OpenAI Codex assistance; Apache-2.0; no independent human or formal proof-assistant review. Base 0b1cccf86e2f5132ed286a26ef0a681a495740ea. Coordination: https://github.com/CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds/discussions/1163#discussioncomment-18924424.\n\n[Exact committed audit artifact](https://github.com/woklerx/integer-mult-bounds/tree/86f11f760119c4fb398d3824a3366a2fe81c6595/research/idle-stability-radical-audit). Commit `86f11f760119c4fb398d3824a3366a2fe81c6595`; base `0b1cccf86e2f5132ed286a26ef0a681a495740ea`. [Coordinated batch](https://github.com/CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds/discussions/1163#discussioncomment-18924424), round 07.\n",
